{"seq":1,"slug":"iap-virtual-goods","title":"内购与虚拟商品","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-monetization-liveops/monetization-design/iap-virtual-goods","wordCount":1325,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"内购与虚拟商品\">内购与虚拟商品</h1><p>内购是免费游戏最基础的一笔交易：玩家用真钱，换取游戏内的物品、货币或权限。听起来简单，但一个内购系统的成败，藏在无数细节里——商店里先看到什么、礼包怎么组合、首充给多少、限时折扣何时弹出。这些设计决定了一个犹豫的玩家会不会按下付款键。2026 年的一个明显趋势是，内购正从静态商店演变为动态、个性化的市场，每个玩家看到的报价都可能不同（<a href=\"https://www.tekrevol.com/blogs/mobile-game-monetization/\">Tekrevol, 2026</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>内购商品按它卖的「价值类型」可以分成几大类，理解这套分类是设计商店的起点——不同类型对游戏平衡与玩家观感的影响天差地别。下图把内购商品的谱系展开。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[内购商品] --&gt; B[消耗型&lt;br/&gt;Consumable]&#10;  A --&gt; C[非消耗型&lt;br/&gt;Non-consumable]&#10;  A --&gt; D[权限型&lt;br/&gt;Entitlement]&#10;  B --&gt; B1[货币/体力/材料]&#10;  C --&gt; C1[角色/皮肤/永久解锁]&#10;  D --&gt; D1[订阅/月卡/通行证]&#10;  B1 --&gt; E{价值类型}&#10;  C1 --&gt; E&#10;  E --&gt; F[加速 省时间]&#10;  E --&gt; G[增强 变更强]&#10;  E --&gt; H[装饰 更好看]\">flowchart TD\n  A[内购商品] --&gt; B[消耗型&lt;br/&gt;Consumable]\n  A --&gt; C[非消耗型&lt;br/&gt;Non-consumable]\n  A --&gt; D[权限型&lt;br/&gt;Entitlement]\n  B --&gt; B1[货币/体力/材料]\n  C --&gt; C1[角色/皮肤/永久解锁]\n  D --&gt; D1[订阅/月卡/通行证]\n  B1 --&gt; E{价值类型}\n  C1 --&gt; E\n  E --&gt; F[加速 省时间]\n  E --&gt; G[增强 变更强]\n  E --&gt; H[装饰 更好看]</pre><p>下表对照各类商品的特征与设计要点。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>是否反复购买</th>\n<th>典型商品</th>\n<th>平衡风险</th>\n<th>设计要点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>消耗型</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>钻石、体力、抽卡券</td>\n<td>中（影响进度）</td>\n<td>复购循环、库存提示</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>非消耗型</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>皮肤、永久角色</td>\n<td>低（多为装饰）</td>\n<td>稀缺与收集欲</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>权限型</td>\n<td>周期续费</td>\n<td>月卡、订阅</td>\n<td>低-中</td>\n<td>持续价值兑现</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"商店设计-玩家先看到什么\">商店设计：玩家先看到什么</h2><p>商店是内购的门面，它的信息层级决定了转化。一个好商店不会把上百件商品平铺，而是有清晰的视觉焦点：最想卖的礼包占据顶部黄金位、配上倒计时与「限时」标签制造紧迫感；高价值的锚点礼包用来抬高整体价值感（这套定价心理见<a href=\"../foundations/economy-pricing\">定价与虚拟经济</a>）。商店还要解决「触达」问题——什么时候把商店推到玩家面前。最有效的时机往往不是主动打开商店，而是玩家恰好卡关、缺资源、或刚获得成就的高情绪时刻，用一个恰到好处的报价完成临门一脚。</p>\n<h2 id=\"礼包设计-组合的艺术\">礼包设计：组合的艺术</h2><p>单卖一颗钻石远不如卖一个礼包。礼包把货币、材料、限定外观打包，用「整体比单买省 X%」制造划算感。礼包设计的核心是让玩家感觉占了便宜，同时把客单价拉高。常见结构包括：成长礼包（随等级解锁、分批发放，绑定长期留存）、主题礼包（配合活动与季节）、以及阶梯礼包（买得越多单价越低）。一个礼包的「划算感」可以粗略量化为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>感知价值</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>bundle</mtext></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{感知价值} = \\frac{\\sum_i q_i \\cdot v_i}{P_{\\text{bundle}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">感知价值</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2757em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4397em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">bundle</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.6897em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是礼包内第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 件物品的数量、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是其单独购买的等价价格、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>bundle</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{\\text{bundle}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">bundle</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是礼包售价。这个比值越大于 1，玩家越觉得划算。但要警惕：把比值堆得过高会贬损单品价值，反而扰乱<a href=\"../foundations/economy-pricing\">定价与虚拟经济</a>里建立的价格锚。</p>\n<h2 id=\"首充与转化漏斗\">首充与转化漏斗</h2><p>让玩家掏出第一笔钱，比让他第二次付费难得多。因此几乎所有免费游戏都设有「首充礼包」——以远超平时的性价比（常见为双倍钻石）撬动那关键的第一次付费。一旦突破从未付费到已付费的心理门槛，后续转化会显著容易。这背后是一条清晰的购买漏斗：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>漏斗阶段</th>\n<th>转化动作</th>\n<th>常见流失原因</th>\n<th>优化手段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>看见商品</td>\n<td>商店曝光</td>\n<td>触达时机不对</td>\n<td>情境化弹窗</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>产生兴趣</td>\n<td>点击查看</td>\n<td>价值不清晰</td>\n<td>划算感可视化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>决定购买</td>\n<td>进入支付</td>\n<td>价格犹豫</td>\n<td>首充/限时折扣</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>完成支付</td>\n<td>付款成功</td>\n<td>支付流程卡顿</td>\n<td>简化结算</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这条漏斗的每一级转化率，正是<a href=\"../analytics-ethics/metrics-funnels\">核心指标与漏斗</a>要度量的对象；而首充礼包给多大力度才最优，则是<a href=\"../analytics-ethics/ab-experimentation\">A/B 实验与优化</a>的经典实验题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"直连网页商店-绕开平台抽成\">直连网页商店：绕开平台抽成</h2><p>2026 年内购领域最大的结构性变化，是直连消费者的网页商店（D2C web shop）兴起：开发者在游戏外搭建网站，让玩家直接购买货币、礼包与道具（<a href=\"https://www.appsflyer.com/resources/reports/app-marketing-monetization-report/\">AppsFlyer, 2026</a>）。动机很直接——绕开应用商店高达 30% 的平台抽成，把这部分利润留给自己或回馈给玩家（网页价更便宜）。这要求开发者自建支付、账户打通与防欺诈能力，但对收入结构的改善相当可观。它也把变现从「应用内」延伸到了「应用外」，成为运营触达玩家的新渠道。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>内购商品按价值类型分为消耗型、非消耗型、权限型，平衡风险与设计要点各异。</li>\n<li>商店设计重在信息层级与触达时机，高情绪时刻的情境化报价转化最高。</li>\n<li>礼包靠组合制造划算感，感知价值可量化，但堆得过高会扰乱价格锚。</li>\n<li>首充礼包用超高性价比撬动第一次付费，是购买漏斗的关键突破点。</li>\n<li>2026 年直连网页商店兴起，绕开平台抽成，把变现延伸到应用外。</li>\n<li>本篇是抽卡与通行证的交易容器，其价值与概率计算在下一篇详述。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"内购与虚拟商品","id":"内购与虚拟商品"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"商店设计：玩家先看到什么","id":"商店设计-玩家先看到什么"},{"level":2,"text":"礼包设计：组合的艺术","id":"礼包设计-组合的艺术"},{"level":2,"text":"首充与转化漏斗","id":"首充与转化漏斗"},{"level":2,"text":"直连网页商店：绕开平台抽成","id":"直连网页商店-绕开平台抽成"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"定价与虚拟经济","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-monetization-liveops/foundations/economy-pricing"},"next":{"title":"抽卡与战斗通行证","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-monetization-liveops/monetization-design/gacha-battle-pass"}}